		(descr "Analog Devices RI-20-1, 20-lead SOIC_IC wide body with increased creepage (JEDEC MS-013-AD body). D=15.40, E1=7.50, E=10.31, e=1.27. Pads deliberately shortened at the heel so the pad-row inner clearance is 8.3 mm, preserving the datasheet 8.3 mm creepage/clearance. Pins 1-10 = side 1, 11-20 = side 2.")
